# Architecture & TypeScript Core

## Dependency Rule

```
presentation → application → domain
shared = cross-cutting (stores / hooks / persistence); must not depend on presentation
```

**Domain has NO dependencies on other layers or frameworks.**

## Terminology Index (Hexagonal ↔ This Project)

| Hexagonal concept | Hexagonal layout | This project layer | This project path |
|-------------------|------------------|--------------------|-------------------|
| Driving adapter | `adapter/in` | Presentation + Application | `src/presentation/`, `src/application/` |
| Driven adapter | `adapter/out` | Shared persistence / infra helpers | `src/shared/` (e.g. persistence manager) |
| Outbound port | `domain/port` | Repository / domain service interface | `src/domain/services/`, repository interfaces if added |
| Domain core | `domain` | Domain | `src/domain/entities/`, `domain/services/` |
| Composition / UI shell | — | Presentation | `src/presentation/components/` |

## Forbidden in New Code

- `domain/port/` — prefer domain services / repository interfaces under `domain/`
- `*Port` interface suffix — prefer `*Repository`, `*Service`, or a domain-specific name
- `adapter/in` / `adapter/out` packages — use `presentation/`, `application/`, `shared/`

## Layers

| Layer | Path | Contains |
|-------|------|----------|
| `domain/` | `src/domain/` | Entities, types, domain services (factory, rules) |
| `application/` | `src/application/` | Application services / use-case orchestration |
| `presentation/` | `src/presentation/` | React UI (canvas, panels, charts, templates) |
| `shared/` | `src/shared/` | Zustand stores, hooks, LocalStorage persistence |

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── domain/
│   ├── entities/
│   └── services/
├── application/
│   └── services/
├── presentation/
│   ├── components/
│   └── hooks/
└── shared/
    ├── stores/
    └── hooks/
```

App Router entry lives under `src/app/` (Next.js) and composes presentation.

## Domain Rules

- No React / Next.js imports in `domain/`
- Prefer rich behavior in domain services over anemic bags of fields
- Keep Preferred Terms aligned with [docs/Glossary.md](../../docs/Glossary.md)

## TypeScript Naming

| Type | Rule | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| Component | PascalCase | `ComponentPanel` |
| Store | camelCase + Store | `componentStore` / `useComponentStore` |
| Service | PascalCase + Service | `ComponentManagementService` |
| Types / interfaces | PascalCase | `ThemeConfig` |
| Methods / vars | camelCase | `findById` |
| Constants | UPPER_SNAKE_CASE | `MAX_HISTORY` |
| Files | kebab-case | `component-panel.tsx` |

## Test Naming

```
should_expectedResult_when_condition
```

## Checklist

- [ ] Domain has no outward dependencies
- [ ] No circular dependencies across layers
- [ ] Presentation does not contain domain rules

